      *> Daily Ledger Reconciler (Batch_Protocol).
      *> Input row : opening_balance deposits withdrawals
      *>             overdraft_threshold overdraft_fee
      *> Output row: closing_balance fee_applied overdraft_flag
      *> No ROUNDED anywhere: COBOL default truncation.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DAILY-LEDGER.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE              PIC X(200).
01 WS-EOF               PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOK-OPENING       PIC X(40).
01 WS-TOK-DEPOSITS      PIC X(40).
01 WS-TOK-WITHDRAWALS   PIC X(40).
01 WS-TOK-THRESHOLD     PIC X(40).
01 WS-TOK-FEE           PIC X(40).
01 WS-OPENING           PIC S9(9)V99.
01 WS-DEPOSITS          PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-WITHDRAWALS       PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-THRESHOLD         PIC S9(9)V99.
01 WS-FEE               PIC 9(5)V99.
01 WS-BALANCE           PIC S9(9)V99.
01 WS-FEE-APPLIED       PIC 9(5)V99.
01 WS-FLAG              PIC 9(1).
01 WS-CLOSING           PIC S9(9)V99.
01 WS-ED-CLOSING        PIC -(9)9.99.
01 WS-ED-FEE            PIC Z(4)9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 1
        MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-LINE
        ACCEPT WS-LINE FROM SYSIN
        IF WS-LINE(1:1) = LOW-VALUE OR WS-LINE = SPACES
            MOVE 1 TO WS-EOF
        ELSE
            PERFORM PROCESS-ROW
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    STOP RUN.

PROCESS-ROW.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TOK-OPENING WS-TOK-DEPOSITS WS-TOK-WITHDRAWALS
                   WS-TOK-THRESHOLD WS-TOK-FEE
    UNSTRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-LINE) DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE
        INTO WS-TOK-OPENING WS-TOK-DEPOSITS WS-TOK-WITHDRAWALS
             WS-TOK-THRESHOLD WS-TOK-FEE
    END-UNSTRING
    IF WS-TOK-OPENING = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-OPENING     = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-OPENING)
    COMPUTE WS-DEPOSITS    = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-DEPOSITS)
    COMPUTE WS-WITHDRAWALS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-WITHDRAWALS)
    COMPUTE WS-THRESHOLD   = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-THRESHOLD)
    COMPUTE WS-FEE         = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-FEE)

    COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = WS-OPENING + WS-DEPOSITS - WS-WITHDRAWALS
    IF WS-BALANCE < WS-THRESHOLD
        MOVE WS-FEE TO WS-FEE-APPLIED
        MOVE 1 TO WS-FLAG
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO WS-FEE-APPLIED
        MOVE 0 TO WS-FLAG
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-CLOSING = WS-BALANCE - WS-FEE-APPLIED

    MOVE WS-CLOSING TO WS-ED-CLOSING
    MOVE WS-FEE-APPLIED TO WS-ED-FEE
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ED-CLOSING) " "
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ED-FEE) " " WS-FLAG.
